      'In recognition of his Unwavering Devotion to the Guru, Personal Excellence, and Deep Commitment to the Mutt, exemplifying Seva, Faith, Dedication, and Selfless Service.',
  },
  {
    award: 'Paramahamsa Shodashi Award',
    name: 'Dr. Smt. Gayatri Yogishwaraswami',
    photo: '/images/guru-purnima/awards/gayatri-yogishwaraswami.jpg',
