      'In recognition of her Selfless Service to Society and the Guru, Professional Excellence as a Gold Medalist Doctor, and her life of Humility, Compassion, and Unconditional Love. Her Dedicated Care for His Holiness, Annadana Seva, and Lifelong Commitment to Guru Seva make her a true Embodiment of Seva and an Inspiration to All.',
  },
  {
